main.py
--unwind 6
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
uncaught exception: FAILURE
--
A nested function that only calls into or mutates a list/dict of its
enclosing function refers to the enclosing binding (PLR 4.2.2). The
captured local was created with the guessed type int (so `calls.append`
was an AttributeError) and captures were copied (mutations were lost).
Non-escaping nested functions now receive the container's address.
